Upon termination, the Licensee must cease unlicensed use of the Software and,
where required by the applicable commercial agreement, remove or destroy copies
that the Licensee is no longer authorized to retain.

Sections concerning ownership, restrictions, confidentiality, disclaimers,
limitations of liability, and other provisions that by their nature should
survive termination will survive.

